@startuml Diagrama_de_Actividades_Eliminar_Costo

title Activity Diagram - Delete a Cost

|#LightBlue|User|
|#LightGreen|System|

|User|
start
:Click the delete (trash)\nicon on the cost row;

|System|
:Show confirmation modal\n"Are you sure you want to delete this cost?";

|User|
if (Does the user\nconfirm the deletion?) then (no)
  :Click "Cancel";
  |System|
  :Close the modal\nwithout changes;
  stop
else (yes)
  :Click "Delete" / "Confirm";
endif

|System|
:Remove the row\nfrom the category;
:Recalculate the category subtotal\n(e.g. Total Current Assets);
:Recalculate the general totals\n(Total Assets, Total Liabilities + Equity);
:Recalculate the financial ratios\n(Liquidity Ratio, Acid Test,\nDebt Ratio, Projected ROI);
:Close the modal;

|User|
:View the updated table\nwithout the deleted cost;
stop

@enduml
